WEBVTT

00:18:28.371 --> 00:18:31.871
someone needs to decide
who is the wise human

00:18:31.954 --> 00:18:34.538
or short humans who are looking at the
results. So it's a big difference.

00:18:34.913 --> 00:18:38.746
Someone who who grew up with intelligent
design world view could look at that

00:18:38.746 --> 00:18:41.871
and go, that's a brilliant outcome. Well,
Goldstar done.

00:18:42.079 --> 00:18:46.496
And someone else would say something
is done awfully wrong here. So

00:18:49.163 --> 00:18:54.746
how do you avoid and this is a version of
the problem that a lot of the, I guess,

00:18:54.746 --> 00:18:57.746
Silicon Valley companies are facing
right now in terms of

00:18:57.996 --> 00:19:00.996
the pushback they're getting on the output
of social media and so forth.